  "releaseNotes": "# AgentOS 2.0.0-beta.76\n\n- Uses the JSON Schema library for draft-aware schema navigation and local\n  reference resolution in the published API result-field editor\n- Allows editing locally referenced fields without changing shared definitions\n  or other uses, and retains original constraints and source bindings\n- Presents nullability separately from required-property rules; existing Schema\n  required lists are preserved, and new result properties are required by default\n- Unifies imported and manually created fields, including array element types,\n  nested properties, sibling and child additions, renaming and deletion\n- Protects unsupported reference and composition constraints from unsafe visual\n  edits and prevents incompatible type changes to enumerated or constant values\n- Reuses Runtime `1.0.0-beta.31`; existing sandbox templates remain unchanged",
